<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ItzFizz - Refresh Your World</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;}
body{background:#0a0a0a;color:white;overflow-x:hidden;}
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:20px;background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, #ff6a00 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, #ffcc00 0%, transparent 50%), #0a0a0a;position:relative;}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:20px;}
h1{font-size:clamp(40px,8vw,80px);line-height:0.9;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:20px;}
h1 span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6a00,#ffcc00);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;}
p{font-size:18px;color:#aaa;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:500px;}
.btns{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.btn{padding:16px 32px;border-radius:100px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;transition:0.3s;}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6a00,#ffcc00);color:black;}
.btn-secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:white;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}
.hero-img{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;}
.circle{width:400px;height:400px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffcc00,#ff6a00);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:200px;box-shadow:0 0 100px rgba(255,106,0,0.5);animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-20px)}}
@media(max-width:768px){.container{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;}.btns{justify-content:center;}p{margin:0 auto 30px;}.circle{width:280px;height:280px;font-size:140px;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div>
<div class="badge">🔥 NEW FLAVOUR LAUNCHED</div>
<h1>FEEL THE <br><span>FIZZ.</span><br>TASTE THE <br>MAGIC.</h1>
<p>ItzFizz is not just a drink. It's a burst of happiness, crafted for Gen-Z. 100% Natural, Extra Fizz, Zero Boring.</p>
<div class="btns">
<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Order Now →</a>
<a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">View Flavours</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-img">
<div class="circle">🥤</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</body>
  </html>
